<title>JAPAN: Japan Jan refined copper output up 2.0 pct--MITI.</title>
<headline>Japan Jan refined copper output up 2.0 pct--MITI.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japanese refined copper output in January rose 2.0 percent from the same month last year to 106,640 tonnes, according to preliminary Ministry of International Trade and Industry data released on Thursday.</p>
<p>The MITI data was as follows (in tonnes):</p>
<p>		    Jan 96   yr/yr change   Dec 96</p>
<p> Output	  106,640     +2.0 pct    107,560</p>
<p> Shipments     104,061     +4.2 pct    107,843</p>
<p> Stocks	   52,118     +0.2 pct     47,452</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Commodity Desk +81-3-3432-6179</p>
</text>
